title: 'statement-store: log an error when the v2 DHT path runs on the libp2p backend'
doc:
- audience: Node Operator
  description: |-
    A node started with `--statement-v2-dht` and `--network-backend libp2p` now logs an error.
    The v2 DHT path learns peers only from litep2p discovery and identify events, so on libp2p it
    dials no statement peer and sends statements only to peers that dial in. A network of libp2p
    nodes exchanges no statements.
crates:
- name: sc-network-statement
  bump: patch
